Z||000001||LS1swap||09-09-2001||08:28 AM||||check the clips where the cables hook to the trans sometime they will slip and it will do just as you describe.this is hard to describe but they retain the outer cable sleeve to the trans. if this happens the outer sleeve will move back and forth and not the actual linkage. hope this helps||||reg||1
